00:38:19,619 --> 00:38:22,619
ほぼ人間だよね。
Almost all humans, right?

193
00:38:22,619 --> 00:38:28,119
ほぼ人間だよ、人間以外、誰がいるんだよ！
Almost humans? Who else would be here besides humans?!

