01:00:36,940 --> 01:00:40,640
G-A-M-E-R-S

480
01:00:57,140 --> 01:01:00,640
G-A-M-E-R-S

481
01:01:02,940 --> 01:01:06,640
G-A-M-E-R-S

482
01:01:34,340 --> 01:01:35,140
ミオ！
Mio!

483
01:01:55,440 --> 01:01:56,240
おかゆ！
Okayu!

484
01:02:26,640 --> 01:02:30,140
G-A-M-E-R-S

485
